# Jarvis's conversational model. Created with:
#   ollama create llama31-voice -f deploy/ollama/llama31-voice.Modelfile
#
# Why llama3.1:8b: the only small model measured that holds a view and
# modulates length (see the decision comment in ~/.zeroclaw/config.toml and
# ROUTING_GUIDE.md Session 11).
#
# num_ctx: stock Ollama serves every model at 4096, which truncated the
# ~9000-character ZeroClaw system prompt plus conversation memory. A voice
# request is ~4K tokens, so 8192 would also do: measured 2026-10-02 it uses
# 5.9 GB instead of 7.0, but gave the co-resident coder only ~15% (the two
# models need ~26 GB together on a 21 GB card either way). Kept at 16384.
FROM llama3.1:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0.45
